      info
          - the generated client for `LspAdvanced`: semantic tokens, inlay hints, diagnostics
          + le client généré pour `LspAdvanced` : jetons sémantiques, indications inline,
          + diagnostics
    entry #workspace
      info
          - the generated client for `LspWorkspace`: symbols, commands, file operations
          + le client généré pour `LspWorkspace` : symboles, commandes, opérations sur fichiers
    entry #resolve
